+/*
+ * Samsung S5K2T8 20 MP image sensor driver (ZTE Axon 7 rear camera)
+ *
+ * Register sequences come from the sensor library in the phone's stock
+ * camera stack (libmmcamera_s5k2t8.so): four init blocks and the mode
+ * tables. Structure follows the s5kjn1 driver.
+ */
